<title>MALAWI: MALAWI HOME AFFAIRS MINISTER DIES AFTER ILLNESS.</title>
<headline>MALAWI HOME AFFAIRS MINISTER DIES AFTER ILLNESS.</headline>
<dateline>BLANTYRE 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malawi's Home Affairs Minister Wenham Nakanga died on Tuesday in a South African hospital after a short illness, state radio reported.</p>
<p>Nakanga is the fifth serving cabinet minister to die since Malawi became a multiparty state in 1994.</p>
<p>---- Johannesburg newsroom 27-11 482-1003</p>
</text>
